1
00:00:02,168 --> 00:00:05,922
Did you give any more thought
to what we talked about?

2
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:10,686
Not yet.

3
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:15,098
I mean, Ji-sung's great

4
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:18,101
but he doesn't have
pro experience.

5
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:22,772
Still...

6
00:00:24,816 --> 00:00:26,609
Then how about this?

7
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:30,363
Let's keep it between us.

8
00:00:31,364 --> 00:00:34,159
Ji-sung doesn't need to know.

9
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:37,287
Sound good?

10
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:46,629
Stop.

11
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:50,425
Ji-sung wouldn't
push you this far, huh?

12
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:55,346
But...

13
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:58,183
Ji-sung said to be careful
with my knee.

14
00:00:58,183 --> 00:00:59,976
That's the problem!

15
00:00:59,976 --> 00:01:01,686
Playing it safe

16
00:01:01,686 --> 00:01:04,689
won't get you
back on the field.

17
00:01:05,690 --> 00:01:09,444
You want to go pro?
You have to push.

18
00:01:19,925 --> 00:01:21,340
How was training?

19
00:01:23,207 --> 00:01:24,750
Tough...

20
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:28,895
but I feel something changing.

21
00:01:29,502 --> 00:01:30,753
Yeah?

22
00:01:31,172 --> 00:01:34,091
You didn't tell
Ji-sung, did you?

23
00:01:34,659 --> 00:01:38,455
No. Didn't want him to worry.

24
00:01:38,504 --> 00:01:40,506
Good.

25
00:01:40,728 --> 00:01:44,899
Sometimes, you've got to
carry things on your own.
